Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:03:22.70,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 男单半决赛
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:03:22.70,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}谢尔顿 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}4-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}3 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 蒂亚福 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, Ben, you've just made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.04,0:00:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢尔顿 你刚刚打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,your very first Grand Slam final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,生涯第一个大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:09.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and you've done it on home soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:09.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且是在自己的主场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk to me about the significance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我聊聊这场球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.28,EN,,0,0,0,,of this match,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.24,0:00:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,意味着什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.80,EN,,0,0,0,,especially considering you played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.28,0:00:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是这一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,such a good friend in Frances for your spot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,你要跟蒂亚福这样的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,争一个决赛席位
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean, first on FO,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.40,0:00:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 首先说蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,he's like a he's like a big brother to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,他对我来说就像大哥一样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,To to be honest, every time that we get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 每一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,to take this court together, Arthur Ashe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们能一起站上阿瑟·阿什
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and play each other is super special.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这儿交手 都意义非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,But this is where we want
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我们想站的就是这个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to be at the at the tail end
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一项赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,of this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,打到最后的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,This is both of our favorite tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我们俩最爱的赛事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in the world, our favorite court in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.28,0:00:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是我们最爱的球场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And to be able to light it up in front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.96,0:00:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,能在你们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,of you guys is the best feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.24,0:00:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,把这儿点燃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:47.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是世上最好的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:52.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You made the semis here three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,三年前你在这儿打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You made the semis here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.24,0:00:54.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年你又一次打进半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.00,EN,,0,0,0,,What's different about the Ben Shelton here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:56.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,2026 年的谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.20,EN,,0,0,0,,in 2026 as opposed to the Ben Shelton
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,和第一次闯进美网半决赛的他
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that made his very first US Open semi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.20,0:01:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么不一样？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 我觉得我长大了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm more mature, more focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,更成熟 也更专注
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I know what my goal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.28,0:01:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道我的目标是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I know what my job is out here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,知道我在这儿的任务是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:11.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm 100% committed to those goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.24,0:01:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,百分之百扑在那些目标上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.52,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not easy playing here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.76,0:01:13.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这儿打球本来就不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,on Arthur Ashe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是阿瑟·阿什球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:14.88,EN,,0,0,0,,You're playing in front
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打球的时候 台下坐着
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of all your favorite athletes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,全是你最喜欢的运动员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:19.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and and movie movie stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.08,0:01:19.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有电影明星
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.04,EN,,0,0,0,,So to be able to keep your head down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能一直低着头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and focus for over 3 hours
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.04,0:01:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,专注三个多小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.12,EN,,0,0,0,,is not an easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的不是件容易的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:28.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I keep on looking up at the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.12,0:01:28.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我总是忍不住抬头
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,at the screen like, "Oh, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,看那块大屏幕 心想 哎呀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Jaylen Brunson's here." So, I got to ask this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,布伦森也来了 那我得问这个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.72,EN,,0,0,0,,2003 since the last time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,上一次美国男子拿下这个冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.48,EN,,0,0,0,,an American man won this title,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是 2003 年
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but it's been since 1972 that a black man
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.48,0:01:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,而上一次有黑人球员
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,has played in the final of the US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.60,0:01:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进美网决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was Arthur Ashe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.84,0:01:52.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,要追溯到 1972 年的阿瑟·阿什
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,On Sunday, you will step foot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,周日你将踏上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.32,EN,,0,0,0,,on the on Arthur Ashe Stadium looking
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.28,0:01:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,阿瑟·阿什球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to take your very first Grand Slam title.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.32,0:02:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,去争夺生涯第一个大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,When you hear
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.72,0:02:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你听到这些
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,that, what goes through your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在为周日做准备的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,as you prepare for Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.04,0:02:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里会想些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:05.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's a lot of emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:05.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 百感交集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,My dad my mom has s sacrificed a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸 我妈妈为我付出了太多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,for me to be in this position today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.80,0:02:10.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,才有我今天站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.08,EN,,0,0,0,,My my dad lost his mom earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我爸爸今年早些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,this year and and she's the reason
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.08,0:02:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,失去了他的母亲 而正是因为她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:17.20,EN,,0,0,0,,that he was able to play tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:17.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,他才有机会打网球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Without her, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.20,0:02:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.72,EN,,0,0,0,,there's no Ben Shelton standing here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就没有今天站在这儿的谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:26.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So, th this one is for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 这一个是为她赢的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,This one is for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一个 是为她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to need you guys
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,周日我需要你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:39.24,EN,,0,0,0,,on Sunday to to bring the energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:39.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,把气氛给我点起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:43.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm going for it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:43.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会全力去拼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave it all on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.44,0:02:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,把所有东西都留在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I hope you guys come and back me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望你们能来支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's do this for the USA.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,为美国 我们一起拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.76,EN,,0,0,0,,And one more thing, it's a it's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:57.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这个日子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.60,EN,,0,0,0,,a difficult day to be out here playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.76,0:02:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,站在这儿打球其实很不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:01.76,EN,,0,0,0,,My thoughts and prayers go out to all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:01.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的心和祈祷 献给所有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.40,EN,,0,0,0,,the families who are impacted by 9/11.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.76,0:03:04.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,被 9/11 影响的家庭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:08.00,EN,,0,0,0,,This is one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of the greatest greatest cities in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,世界上最伟大的城市之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and one of the biggest tragedies,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,也承受过最大的悲剧之一
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.84,EN,,0,0,0,,but, yeah, thoughts and prayers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,愿我们的思念和祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to everyone involved and affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,陪着每一个经历过的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, New York's going to come out
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,放心 周日整个纽约
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,for you on Sunday, ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.56,0:03:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,都会为你而来 女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:23.50,EN,,0,0,0,,through to his first US Open final.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:23.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,他闯进了生涯第一个美网决赛
